<title>UK: Dresdner leads warrants on French bank basket.</title>
<headline>Dresdner leads warrants on French bank basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banque Internationale de Placement has issued a total of one million European-style call warrants, on a French bank basket comprising Banque Nationale de Paris, Credit Local de France, Societe Generale and Banque Paribas, lead manager Dresdner Bank Group said.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    5700.00 FFR	     PREMIUM	18.15 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     39.30 FFR		 GEARING	=</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   30.JUN.98		 PAYDATE	14.OCT.96</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
